    Fixes a bug in filter building, where the filter building scratch space
    in trunk_compact_bundle_req would not be zeroed out when the filter
    build extends to a sibling causing unexpected failures. The fix creates
    a new struct trunk_filter_req which stores this scratch and is allocated
    on the stack.
    
    Fixes a bug in trunk_replace_bundle_branches, where end_branch would be
    adjusted before the pivot tuple counts are adjusted, causing dead pivots
    to appear live, resulting in unexpected behavior and failures.
    
    Fixes another bug in trunk_replace_bundle_branches, where pivot start
    bundles would not be adjusted in the empty compaction case.
    
    Fixes a bug in next node transition in trunk_bundle_build_filters.  The
    bug occured due to duplication amond variables in filter_req and
    compact_req. The node fetching mechanism uses compact_req for the node
    addr, whereas the addr was being updated on next node transition for
    filter_req.  Fixes the bug by removing the node addr, height, bundle_no,
    etc., fields from filter_req, so that they are not duplicated.
    
