    1. Verifies that a pivot with tuples in a whole branch has a filter
    2. Verifies that the subbundle filter indices match in subbundles and
       header
    
    In order to verify 1 above, switches tuple accounting in pivots to split
    the tuples in bundles and in whole branches.
    
