    Clean up clockcache_prefetch
    
    This commit resolves several outstanding issues with
    clockcache_prefetch.
    
    1. clockcache_prefetch used to only check that the first page of an
       extent was in cache. Now it checks every page.
    2. clockcache_prefetch doesn't set the page_type of the entries
       correctly; this is fixed through an API change.
    3. clockcache_prefetch would fetch every page in the extent if the first
       page was out of cache, regardless of whether they were in cache. Now
       only pages out of cache are fetched in contiguous IOs.
    4. Basic stats on prefetching and writing are implemented.

